ding=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/yp6xJV0XicrrwKKia3hicQcNjW1c7vVem67RhAty5Yky6OPBfbuJHqHI0hZpUibG1gzmHbT8xgLic1BrfiaQLUWotHnp87A5tAatSiaEB6wknqt0Gk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为增进优秀大学生对江西中医药大学的深入了解，促进优秀大学生之间的交流，了解食药同源理论的现代化发展动态，体验食药同源产品研发的魅力。现招募江西中医药大学2026年优秀大学生暑期“未来食品营养与生物医药前沿”夏令营营员，具体内容如下：</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/yp6xJV0Xicrpia5fJMbGOWfP5WnpMbbHpmTtCZKETtQS0vUib5ODK1Lhfw8hzx03paHMkMmMvt6aj3rHZvjorPPpywpmgYSSOU7feEicBTH23hI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>活动目的</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/yp6xJV0Xicrpq4NdfiaMIUKKu116suKiclB4FnvjEYs3qUoNujAve80PvGV4lgzr3IhRkAC0PBEN9k65bxUd1pQ5uyrlR0b78HG3BX45qllIr0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>食药同源是中医药与食品、营养等学科交叉的重要领域，也是中医药文化服务全民健康的重要抓手，兼具深厚的文化底蕴与广阔的产业转化前景。夏令营融入食药同源理论源流与现代发展，培养文化传承意识与创新思维，增进大学生对中医药文化的深度认同，提升文化自信与民族自豪感。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/yp6xJV0XicrqhutmeJcjm6ic3IaAicyNg2QcJIh0DbPOoxg93G5kWLrW940bfANlynKhX0w8kGzT3Sz2tXHibpuEcSSR7rJTibQrdoXtSbzZjiaFE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>活动内容</span></span></p></section></section><