no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/yp6xJV0XicrrpUdQh8NjiaiamNic6DibpWh2uicEepFXwRqywmMUxa8t2KGbs1GuUGLjUjBWXjCtEUPYafYjxk9S96Jic7qw7ibticZCgtG64LbBQkT4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>招募对象与申请条件</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/yp6xJV0XicrpzMLfH3IWiaCH6ceyibYevWF0AwD6fgjZRnWtiaWd22KBfBh6wPsyPdEzHP3HtvDChbbj1pqxicsrYUccoQ1dGuS5SxOqn4V5uVn0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>面向全国普通高等院校食品、发酵工程、制药工程、中药学、药学等相关专业背景2027/2028届全日制本科生，计划招收营员20-25人。满足以下条件者可报名：</span></p><p><span>1.具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，恪守学术道德，在校期间未受过任何法纪处分，身心健康；</span></p><p><span>2.学习成绩优良，所有必修课程成绩合格；</span></p><p><span>3.对食品、发酵工程、制药工程等领域有浓厚兴趣，具有较强的科研潜力；</span></p><p><span>4.英语水平良好，具备良好的英语阅读、理解与应用能力。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/yp6xJV0XicrpPPnlg9kocJ8h7Ym3kAcngwOA0JLzgcZlEnwWUOh49MfsuAx6azzY3pf90wFcQdva0wNoVtmdrfVGL7gmBvY4gE3hrkQQgjQI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>申请流程与结业要求</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/yp6xJV0Xicrp79yLd378IuoTOIsoGRDTXVyR5elHvJs1FO4QPmUHKOpicWtd07CuZdTGw3PtXbbgxMGnwDSqTxiaSEWjZiajfh4BaFiczCZvxshY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.网上申请</span></p><p><span>请有报名意向的学生扫描下方二维码填写申请表。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/yp6xJV0Xicrpz7ZiaYx3GkZsicAtYAeMS1Zu90eQFuzaw2jiamSFVKG9egXNFB87AmnKTjBrUlQ38mrnyvwPAJ1aibw8y8modzGUlUYsgtK7mzb4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span>报名截止时间：2026年8月28日17:00</span></p><section><p><span>2.结业要求</span></p><p><span>活动结束后，所有营员须独立完成不少于600字的心得体会，总结收获、实践感悟与未来学习规划，发送至邮箱znh597851323@163.com。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/yp6xJV0XicroWicInoUMWEKAYwicX0MFozHodicaoOfCmQfHd3y5638bGCsmuBXa5tfah0D2V3iaGGp9oId609PuDeXIuTmq4g46vuFHldrw9wf4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>报到与活动安排</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/yp6xJV0XicrrsqQ5Vld4nRSiaKfiafm2cLOFZdmps5UEU1RBK7OPkYKodDujGvAjxjOyX9GzXuZx8p02rzCcWT1rQnRwgHWwySmP1cuEz4gBYo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1 报到安排</span></p><p><span>（1）报到时间：8月29日8:00至8:50</span></p><p><span>（2）报到地点：江西中医药大学湾里校区实验楼C座430</span></p><p><span>2 活动安排</span></p><p><span>（1）8月29日全天</span></p><p><span>报到、领取物资及材料；开营仪式；学院、教研室介绍，学科发展规划；专家前沿学术报告；师生座谈交流；食药同源产品开发科研实践；考研与读研心得分享。</span></p><p><span>（2）8月30日全天</span></p><p><span>“生物与医药”硕士研究生报考、招生政策；企业参观见习；营员风采展示及主题汇报；优秀营员评选、闭营仪式。</span></p><p><span>注：日程为拟定计划，具体安排可能会进行适当调整。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>3</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/yp6xJV0XicrqQLuhmyIvlvJR1ZEY5uz9j6KIwvZbf8GxNlUZKkS16CHVga6IxJ1QBGmvm1NDg1uAhOiaKDLP6pbFEVuKuhLrDxQw3tnEqos3o/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>相关保障与须知</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/yp6xJV0XicrpT1REKFL4vM99kWGxIYpQpian8rAzoHhTTIZjQicXiafelzUpes526uteT4slOYibbAicicTyGOb2FeCuQWX0AibrxZs2vKR6Y3ewWsg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>相关保障说明</span></p><p><span>1.本次夏令营用餐费、住宿费、交通费由项目经费统一承担，全程不收取学生报名费、培训费及其他费用。</span></p><p><span>2.校内营员住宿自行安排，校外营员将统一安排住宿。</span></p><p><span>3.南昌市外高校学生可报销往返硬座火车票费用（需要车票，高铁限二等座），原则上需为所在本科学校城市或者家庭所在地至南昌的往返行程。</span></p><p><span>注意事项</span></p><p><span>1.所有报名材料须真实、准确、有效。凡存在弄虚作假者，一经查实，将取消入营资格。</span></p><p><span>2.营员须严格遵守学校规章制度与夏令营管理要求，服从带队老师统一安排，不得擅自离队、私自外出。遇突发情况须第一时间向工作人员报备。</span></p><p><span>3.营员须按时参加各项学习、实践等环节，不得无故缺席、缺勤。</span></p><p><span>4.所由解释权均归江西中医药大学夏令营负责团队所有。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>联系人与联系方式</span></p><p><span>张老师：18801301703</span></p><p><span>董老师：18070072040</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>江西中医药大学药学院</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>2026年8月26日</span></p></section></section></section><section><span><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/chxzQD5fAstoicrfGdfILhcV5tVAwLqNiaiadZiaH4TQWC7tCJO3G1nrtEbUuhr2IYIibwUSibshD29WTTFwwhK5iarXA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp#imgIndex=8\"/></span><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>来源 | 药学院</span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>文稿编辑 | 吴昊冉</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>责</span></span></span><span><span><span>任</span></span></span><span><span><span>编</span></span></span><span><span><span>辑 </span></span></span><span><span><span>| 王飞鹏</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>审</span></span></span><span><span><span>核 </span></span></span><span><span><span>|</span></span